## Parameters

> **SDK 方法参数。**

| Name | Type | Required | Description |
| ---- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| id | int64 | 是 | 提醒 ID（路径参数） |

## Request Example



```python
from longbridge.openapi import AlertContext, Config, OAuthBuilder

oauth = OAuthBuilder("your-client-id").build(lambda url: print("Visit:", url))
