## Parameters

> **SDK method parameters.**

| Name   | Type    | Required | Description                                                     |
| ------ | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| symbol | string  | YES      | Security symbol; supports US (e.g. `TSLA.US`) and HK (e.g. `700.HK`) |
